{"help": "https://www.envidat.ch/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"author": "[{\"affiliation\": \"WSL\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"email\": \"nicola.vkoppenhagen@wsl.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Nicola\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"van Koppenhagen\"}]", "author_email": null, "creator_user_id": "95878c42-7b4f-47f4-91cd-9f7a9e4a223f", "date": "[{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"date_type\": \"created\", \"end_date\": \"2024-11-30\"}, {\"date\": \"2021-06-23\", \"date_type\": \"collected\", \"end_date\": \"2023-06-29\"}]", "doi": "10.16904/envidat.566", "funding": "[{\"grant_number\": \"\", \"institution\": \"Swiss Federal Resaerch Institute WSL\", \"institution_url\": \"\"}]", "id": "f85c7171-2635-43ba-81f5-6b01b56500d2", "isopen": true, "language": "en", "license_id": "CC0-1.0", "license_title": "Creative Commons Zero - No Rights Reserved (CC0 1.0)", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "maintainer": "{\"affiliation\": \"\", \"email\": \"nicola.vkoppenhagen@wsl.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Nicola\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"van Koppenhagen\"}", "maintainer_email": null, "metadata_created": "2024-12-09T15:39:34.905908", "metadata_modified": "2025-06-16T12:03:03.567248", "name": "alan---nature-sustainability", "notes": "Raw data and R Code to do all the analysis performed for the paper \"Advancing sustainable LED solutions to mitigate light-pollution impacts on arthropods\". Including data for both flight-active insects and ground-dwelling arthropods combined (PT_TRF_all.csv), flight-active insects alone (ALANeX_PT_all_clean_control.csv) and ground-dwelling insects alone (ALANeX_TRF_all_clean_control.csv). For the NMDS analysis, there is a data set for the flight-active insects (ALANeX_PT_NMDS.csv) and the ground-dwelling arthropods (ALANeX_TRF_NMDS.csv). For the Morans I use the 'ALANeX_MoransI.csv' dataset.", "num_resources": 13, "num_tags": 5, "organization": {"id": "2